[Unit]
Description=Export Fritzbox WAN stats (UPnP) to the node_exporter textfile collector
Documentation=file:///home/chef/src/homebase/docs/services.md
# POSTs SOAP actions to the FRITZ!Box :49000 (unauthenticated UPnP, LAN-only)
